      "source": "Central repository marker interface. Captures the domain type to manage as well as the domain type's id type. General\npurpose is to hold type information as well as being able to discover interfaces that extend this one during\nclasspath scanning for easy Spring bean creation.",
      "translation": "中央存储库标记接口。用于捕获要管理的域类型以及该域类型的 ID 类型。其通用目的是保存类型信息，并能够在类路径扫描期间发现扩展此接口的接口，以便轻松创建 Spring Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
